        <mxCell id="local-boundary" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;white-space:normal;&quot;&gt;Client boundary rules (not Hub stores or processes): 1. Local work remains QUEUED_FOR_SYNC until an acknowledgement receipt. 2. Apply the complete pull page AND next_cursor in one local transaction; roll back both on failure. 3. On reset, rebuild the mirror while keeping queued work; continue pulling while has_more is true. 4. seq is the cursor; server_time is only for clock offset. There is no sync_status column in the master schema. D6 Tutor History is not in the current SyncPullResponse. Adjacent domain processes are dashed.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1" kind="note">
